                    <signifLet xml:id="m-e2b7d568-e2b4-4543-af8d-dbaaa893c051" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-b4dbe42d-5347-4024-aab2-be247d4482ae" facs="#m-fd5ddd3e-31ef-4892-9e55-6341ca2422e5" form="minima" /><custos xml:id="m-e8861b6e-2f53-4146-976b-aff5f8a45b3d" facs="#m-8caeaf8c-89a1-4766-877f-b9ea810b4854" pname="f" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-4c5ad297-f2cf-4000-8e90-52146ff4a7da"><lg xml:id="m-7833116b-8c90-48d2-9e3e-ee029dd570ab"><l xml:id="m-6e3cd16d-5002-430f-ac80-b77d07e2c046" facs="#m-87f92a64-c205-4ecb-a667-b18d611a744e" label="ambiguous">1596</l><l xml:id="m-e8be2e1e-220f-45ef-ba2b-7ca5dceab487" facs="#m-4465fe99-0806-4803-bf1e-7186acc9b3f4" label="ambiguous">August I0.</l><l xml:id="m-3aa40c26-18c4-4455-a6b3-4ca66cc8e49d" facs="#m-83c2150e-c28c-4e1d-a536-4aa9a0eaeed6" label="ambiguous">in sancti-fi-ca-ti¬ 6</l><l xml:id="m-732b60fb-c10b-4ad1-9a8c-cbf61fa041bf" facs="#m-ca08282e-a034-425c-84f9-42b53f25d916" label="lyrics-like">fi- cén¬ ti¬ a</l><l xml:id="m-f3962e98-704d-4358-be46-5458f58b113b" facs="#m-601c15c3-30b3-4357-86cb-919008c6bd60" label="ambiguous">ne</l><l xml:id="m-cf4cba72-4f3d-4bb5-b950-81b5c854297c" facs="#m-8345b11d-ec70-430a-a2ed-63d37f5ab99e" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcbc29f4-47f7-49cd-92c2-7f7945d5ee93" facs="#m-784bb390-aecb-4dac-aa25-96db8330a96e" label="ambiguous">jus.</l><l xml:id="m-927fd656-e29d-4249-8f5b-702a286a9846" facs="#m-489a5112-29de-49ac-b36a-f3f0a689438a" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-4e4785b8-5d6e-42df-8caf-c50f1ad57456" facs="#m-072c3e69-55ee-4096-91dd-1392d0bd5716" label="lyrics-like">HCcipe, quaésumus Dómine, mú¬ nostrae salútis auxilium provenire</l><l xml:id="m-e5cdd4dd-050b-48b2-a52d-00ae02daa7d9" facs="#m-1ecc82a1-5698-437a-9cd7-61f379c0b392" label="lyrics-like">I nera dignánter obláta: et beáti l concéde. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-6d18f63c-072c-4339-9e24-915fbbaa3e30" facs="#m-9d0ab14d-26c8-4ff1-b414-12c328748c21" label="lyrics-like">Lauréntii suffragántibus méritis, ad</l><l xml:id="m-e76f3f2e-08b1-42f2-858f-03d1ca430805" facs="#m-8349ea8a-8320-40db-bed5-92024b9137eb" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Qui mihi minístrat. p. 1141.</l><l xml:id="m-9329b360-8360-4813-9e58-9af376d286fb" facs="#m-aec2f190-ac3f-44a3-8f40-539b834c8a07" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-af148545-102e-46ee-99db-df8240e49e74" facs="#m-0e83536f-769b-4e49-8391-f6354710df2e" label="lyrics-like">YAcro múnere satiáti, súpplices! tio Mártyre tuo, salvatiónis tuae</l><l xml:id="m-1b820612-d116-4028-84cb-e0062aa32de4" facs="#m-062c3700-1f01-4dd0-80dd-96017bf57471" label="lyrics-like">O te Dómine deprecámur: ut</l><l xml:id="m-c97a0030-9b18-434f-966d-3abb034b9547" facs="#m-27101e55-6be5-4dcc-af31-e9dad0714e26" label="lyrics-like">sentiámus augméntum. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-11f3f4ec-4a47-409f-bae1-a1ec333e25ea" facs="#m-1250bac6-d110-4e50-ac63-c9548a4d4ce9" label="lyrics-like">quod débitae servitûtis celebrámus</l><l xml:id="m-99eddd3c-7d26-442e-86cc-f752d725a0b5" facs="#m-307195fa-5cbd-47c7-8bad-e1aeb6b7bf36" label="ambiguous">num nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-5fd19c3c-cd4b-447c-9d1c-3d7c7ab9b61d" facs="#m-189672cf-cd3d-4da2-ae09-b62f249415df" label="lyrics-like">officio, intercedénte beáto Laurén¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2c25f1c-2a17-4c0b-88fd-7e22c3e4a39a" facs="#m-40813d6e-3f64-40da-95e9-d4e7e1afcfa5" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-1875f915-8b03-401d-ac90-5b64d0236143" facs="#m-563134a9-1b35-46a9-8de4-94132b927226" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Adhaésit. p. 1597.</l><l xml:id="m-b0aa7737-734d-4602-ba2c-ac55e84fc3e6" facs="#m-635bd687-3942-486a-84b6-d4f34cbd2ebe" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-23c8f61b-64fb-42e8-aacc-f05686a289da" facs="#m-1fba5859-0cb1-4346-a809-9eb02b078dff" label="ambiguous">2. Cor. 9. b.</l><l xml:id="m-11f4f668-ce89-415c-bfd7-068fb0760fcc" facs="#m-ff72db65-3744-4b7a-81dc-e6982851981d" label="lyrics-like">(Nusquísque prout destinávit in ] aut ex necessitáte: * hilarem enim</l><l xml:id="m-0c1aae6e-bf65-4567-a562-c32e8746a40b" facs="#m-1a599b2c-fbb4-47a4-b0d3-45825af22eec" label="lyrics-like">U corde suo, t non ex tristitia, l datórem diligit Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-ccd0ba42-3ea6-4270-861b-1ec42be1d032" facs="#m-50d8616e-2449-464b-99e6-1c6c6f7382af" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Posuisti Dómine. p. 1124. V. Mágna est</l><l xml:id="m-38881c94-d36b-49c6-a539-e6535da63d44" facs="#m-c42720ab-a935-4e02-b263-cdb8a1fecc5e" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-0608383f-5786-470f-a742-ca8e6b95ece5" facs="#m-d8db7d00-cb00-47c8-b620-d9377cf74e76" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Beátus Lauréntius. D. 1597.</l><l xml:id="m-7f487760-3ec1-4f9c-bcaa-0dd6de1997c7" facs="#m-c27f7da3-b338-4953-8415-d0b0d23d9fd2" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-b7aeef4c-4052-4918-acfa-90a058dc9948" facs="#m-e92c06a9-bcce-454d-8dc0-be945c1bf1d0" label="ambiguous">2. Cor. 9. c.</l><l xml:id="m-080d076b-d468-4f15-9954-2c933b6ea9d9" facs="#m-03d2f0c0-d370-4540-bdbb-4fd64e9d1e21" label="ambiguous">DOtens est autem Deus omnem omne opus bonum, sicut scriptum</l><l xml:id="m-e742c4fd-af40-4acf-a0cc-e7a6794fed38" facs="#m-94e9b520-629e-445e-985e-7ae4007bef4a" label="lyrics-like">Egrátiam abundáre fácere in vo¬ est : Dispérsit, dedit paupéribus:</l><l xml:id="m-390af8d4-9773-41cc-bbbc-d98d8af97ac3" facs="#m-bcbea31e-0f57-452f-966b-4fa9351d1d16" label="lyrics-like">bis: T ut in ómnibus semper omneml justitia ejus manet in saéculum saé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f360e2cc-5d56-4d22-8bef-eec1ff8a5892" facs="#m-64a1857c-f596-4667-ac68-4350a5b191ef" label="lyrics-like">sufficiéntiam habéntes, abundétis in l culi.</l><l xml:id="m-e9f21586-519e-41f1-bfac-67517f301e11" facs="#m-86768fee-c898-44e0-b8c9-c752db66466a" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Mágna est. p. 1125. Y. Jústus.</l><l xml:id="m-2c6c31ae-b9e6-4064-b53f-042e700e44cc" facs="#m-44f1dca0-89d7-4b6f-be8a-656c760050c4" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-b8ed7f84-0f6f-4e63-93d7-e19fd6531056" facs="#m-d4029334-9d70-49d5-88d2-8e72575890c7" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 1. f. p. 128. — 2. Confitébor. 8. G. p. 140. —</l><l xml:id="m-41f69b43-bb43-4c79-8cba-3ceb983f6e6d" facs="#m-5d6efefa-379a-425a-849c-2fcaeb562c6b" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. 8. G. p. 147.— 4. Laudáte púeri. 7. c 2. p. 151.— 5. Crédidi.</l><l xml:id="m-869e8aa8-3dab-4acc-b32d-1ea2db9f06ce" facs="#m-9e770a38-f5ba-40c4-a502-0baca76b80c7" label="ambiguous">8. G. p. 165.</l><l xml:id="m-5ed2857c-7344-40e3-a4f5-759f9e521e27" facs="#m-a335d02f-e3c7-41bb-8639-68f3fbb71676" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-9e142911-ce47-4bc1-8098-b3a802143a4b" facs="#m-e431b3a9-1121-423c-9b2e-ef265f54ef24" label="ambiguous">1.1</l><l xml:id="m-c14d26aa-f09d-41a1-a6af-e01deb01c259" facs="#m-64009f17-d359-4690-b9e2-e42209eea038" label="lyrics-like">Aurénti-us"ingréssus est: mártyres conféssi sunt</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
